1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,289
So remember this.

2
00:00:01,289 --> 00:00:04,635
Atomic weight and molar mass are fixed numbers.

3
00:00:04,635 --> 00:00:06,822
Equivalent weight is not.

4
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:08,385
It depends on the reaction.

5
00:00:08,385 --> 00:00:13,398
Before you quote an equivalent weight, always ask: in which reaction?

